      *-------- SORT FILE DEFINITION FOR USE IN MATERIALS CONTROL
      *-------- REPORTS WHICH USE COMMON SCREENS IN "ZMTLCNTL".

       SD  SORT-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 211 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS SORT-REC.
       01  SORT-REC.
           05  SRT-CORP-CODE          PIC X(10).
           05  SRT-CLASS              PIC X(4).
           05  SRT-PRIM-LOC           PIC X(12).
           05  SRT-DFLT-DEPT          PIC X(6).
           05  SRT-UM                 PIC X(2).
           05  SRT-ONHAND             PIC S9(8).
           05  SRT-COST               PIC S9(11)V9(4).
           05  SRT-MAX                PIC S9(8).
           05  SRT-KEYWD-MOD          PIC X(50).
           05  SRT-MANUFACT           PIC X(26).
           05  SRT-AUTHOR             PIC X(10).
           05  SRT-REORDER            PIC S9(8).
           05  SRT-EXPEDITE           PIC S9(8).
           05  SRT-PO-NUM             PIC X(7).
           05  SRT-BINLOC             PIC X(12).
           05  SRT-STR                PIC X(2).
           05  SRT-LAST-IDATE         PIC X(6).
           05  SRT-MTH-FCST           PIC S9(8).
           05  SRT-PROJ-USAGE         PIC S9(9).

